# Kimi Linear 48B-A3B Instruct (Moonshot, October 2025): 48B MoE, 3B active, trained
# for a 1M window. Three of every four layers use linear attention, so the cache is
# small. Older than the rest of the list, but built for long prompts and small enough
# to run at 8-bit. It has no thinking mode; fable asks it to think in a <think> block.
TITLE="Kimi Linear 48B-A3B"
DETAIL="48B, 3B active, 8-bit GGUF, 52 GB"
HF_REPO=bartowski/moonshotai_Kimi-Linear-48B-A3B-Instruct-GGUF
HF_INCLUDE="*Q8_0*"
GGUF_MATCH="Q8_0"
ALIAS=kimi-linear-48b
CTX=fit
CTX_MIN=262144
KV_TYPE=f16
MIN_FREE_GB=60
EXTRA_ARGS="--load-mode dio --cache-ram 0 --timeout 14400"
